{"text": " You wake up in 1859 in Titusville, Pennsylvania. It's August, the air smells of mud and tar and men are cheering around a wooden derrick. Did you know that a historian later wrote that oil gave kerosene to the world and life to the few remaining whales? Before this, whaler sailed for years to fill their lamps. Here's your evening. A Canadian doctor, Abraham Gezzner, has already shown how to make a lamp fuel called kerosene. Now Edwin Drake has struck oil 69 feet down just before his money ran out. Kerosene floods the shops. On your table, there's a lamp with a glass chimney and a steady flame and the evening gets hours back. You read, you sow, the children do their lessons. What does one hour of light cost you now? By 1870 in America, about 20 minutes of work. So what is light now? A liquid, something you buy in a can. 23 years later, someone takes the flame away completely.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.22, "text": " You wake up in 1859 in Titusville, Pennsylvania.", "tokens": [50364, 509, 6634, 493, 294, 2443, 19600, 294, 14489, 301, 8386, 11, 17963, 13, 50560], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12945356525358606, "compression_ratio": 1.519572953736655, "no_speech_prob": 0.0025918884202837944, "words": [{"word": " You", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.14, "probability": 0.8468080759048462}, {"word": " wake", "start": 0.14, "end": 0.3, "probability": 0.9872586131095886}, {"word": " up", "start": 0.3, "end": 0.52, "probability": 0.9994916915893555}, {"word": " in", "start": 0.52, "end": 0.62, "probability": 0.9974393844604492}, {"word": " 1859", "start": 0.62, "end": 1.5, "probability": 0.9932241141796112}, {"word": " in", "start": 1.5, "end": 2.02, "probability": 0.8316305875778198}, {"word": " Titusville,", "start": 2.02, "end": 2.58, "probability": 0.9795015056927999}, {"word": " Pennsylvania.", "start": 2.76, "end": 3.22, "probability": 0.9956023693084717}]}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 3.68, "end": 6.94, "text": " It's Augus